Sales Performance Dashboard | Power BI 

Overview 

This project is an interactive sales dashboard developed as part of the 365 Data Science Power BI course taught by Dimitar Shutev. 

The dashboard helps a sales team monitor performance, understand monthly changes, and explore sales across currencies, users, and sales territories. 

Business Questions :

How does sales performance change from month to month? 

How do sales results compare across currencies? 

How does performance vary by user and sales territory? 

Dashboard Features :

Sales performance overview. 

Month-on-month sales analysis. 

Currency selection and comparison. 

Interactive filtering by user, currency, and sales territory. 

Tools and Skills: 

Microsoft Power BI Desktop. 

Data visualization and interactive report design. 

Sales performance analysis. 

How to View 

Download the Power BI report (.pbix) from this repository. 

Open it in  Microsoft Power BI Desktop. 

Use the dashboard filters to explore sales performance. 

Acknowledgment 

This is a guided learning project based on the 365 Data Science Power BI course. 

 
